WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:09.530
Hey youtubers it’s charlie, happy wholock
week.

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:12.780
Hopefully you’ve all had a chance to watch
the doctor who christmas special by now.

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:15.610
Since there were a lot of references to all
era’s of doctor who going back to William

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:18.340
Hartnell I thought it would be fun to try
and find as many as possible.

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:20.530
If you saw my 50th anniversary easter eggs
video it’s a lot like that.

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:23.720
I’ll also be doing a peter capaldi specific
video this weekend as part of my ongoing wholock

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:24.720
celebration.

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:27.039
I’ve got a lot more Sherlock content coming
before the series 3 premiere too.

00:00:27.039 --> 00:00:28.650
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:32.169
Heads up too, I’m giving away one twenty
dollar amazon gift card to a random subscriber

00:00:32.169 --> 00:00:33.379
in the comments for this video.

00:00:33.379 --> 00:00:38.250
Let’s get started this one’s going to
be a whopper, Number 1 - quick and dirty.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:44.469
At sixty minutes, The episode is the shortest
episode ever broadcast on BBC1 featuring a

00:00:44.469 --> 00:00:45.670
regeneration.

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:50.250
Technically the night of the doctor mini episode
only aired on the red service and the web.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:55.690
In contrast, David Tennant’s final regeneration
in the end of time was two hours and fifteen

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:56.690
minutes.

00:00:56.690 --> 00:00:58.730
2 - The Narrator.

00:00:58.730 --> 00:01:01.190
Tasha Lem narrates the beginning of the episode.

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.470
This is the second episode to feature a narrator
at the beginning.

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:07.580
The other time was rassilon during the end
of time.

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:09.590
3 - All who came.

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:14.740
All of the spaceships you see in the wide
shot above trenzalore include, The Daleks,

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:16.380
the Cybermen.

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:26.130
the judoon, the sontarans, the sigh-lurians,
the terileptils, the slitheen family and the

00:01:26.130 --> 00:01:27.860
church of the papal mainframe.

00:01:27.860 --> 00:01:31.020
Although technically they’re an organization,
not a species.

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:36.330
The configuration of their ships is a visual
callback to the enemy alliance during pandorica.

00:01:36.330 --> 00:01:38.200
4 - Not pictured.

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:41.500
The weeping angels, the monoid and the racnoss.

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:45.450
The weeping angels were also on trenzalore,
but they often travel on other people’s

00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:46.450
spaceships.

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:50.319
It’s not fully explained how the landed
on the planet as tasha lem said that they

00:01:50.319 --> 00:01:54.390
created a forcefield to prevent anyone in
orbit from entering the atmosphere.

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:57.670
The monoid isn’t seen on screen, but it
is depicted as a puppet.

00:01:57.670 --> 00:02:01.239
The racnoss were not seen on screen, but were
depicted in one of the children’s drawings

00:02:01.239 --> 00:02:02.480
on the wall of the clocktower.

00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:06.860
It’s implied that they arrived and were
defeated sometime during the long siege of

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:07.860
trenzalore.

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:10.060
5 - The inverness cape.

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:15.100
Matt Smith is wearing an inverness cape similar
to the one worn by The Third Doctor.

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:19.640
Originally Jon Pertwee chose it as a joke
and wore it to a production meeting but it

00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:20.640
stuck.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:24.300
The third doctor character stole the inverness
cape during his debut episode spearhead from

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:25.300
space.

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:26.810
6 - Handles.

00:02:26.810 --> 00:02:31.310
The reprogrammed cybermen head the doctor
is calling handles is a visual reference to

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:34.860
K-9 from the fourth doctor’s run and the
sarah jane adventures.

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:38.470
He even utters K-9’s signature phrase, Affirmative
Master.

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:39.860
7 - The phone.

00:02:39.860 --> 00:02:44.250
This is the third time matt smith has used
the physical phone outside the tardis.

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:47.870
Despite the ninth doctor claiming that it’s
not a real phone during empty child.

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:51.600
It’s revealed that the doctor never uses
it because it’s typically patched through

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:52.820
the tardis console.

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:55.040
8 - Inventing a Boyfriend.

00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:58.370
The doctor tells clara that he had an android
boyfriend once.

00:02:58.370 --> 00:03:02.030
He is referring to Kamelion who was a companion
of the fifth doctor.

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:06.100
He was last seen in a picture on the unit
wall inside the black archives during the

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:07.730
50th anniversary special.

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:09.580
8 - Upgrades.

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:14.220
The cybermen in the episode are the alternate
universe cybus versions, later confirmed in

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:18.100
another drawing on the wall of the clocktower
which feature the phrase “Delete”.

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:20.170
9 - Clara’s mother.

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:24.750
The actress playing her starred previously
in the sontaran stratagem and in the sarah

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:25.750
jane adventures

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:33.030
10 - Clara’s grandmother previously starred
in vengance on varos during the sixth doctor’s

00:03:33.030 --> 00:03:34.030
run.

00:03:34.030 --> 00:03:35.360
11 - The apartment complex.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:39.550
The apartment complex clara’s family lives
in is extremely similar to the one used in

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:42.470
the ninth doctor’s first episode rose.

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:46.370
Interestingly enough the doctor was carrying
around a hand for a large portion of that

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:47.370
episode.

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:49.020
Just like Matt Smith carries around handles.

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:51.120
12 - The doctor is naked.

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:55.940
Matt Smith also appeared stark naked in front
of amy pond during the eleventh hour while

00:03:55.940 --> 00:03:57.130
he chose his new outfit.

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:59.550
The first time his character wore the bowtie.

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:00.550
13 - Holographic Clothes.

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:03.140
He and clara go to the papal mainframe naked,
and are still naked when they land on the

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:04.140
planet.

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:05.319
In a snowstorm.

00:04:05.319 --> 00:04:07.100
Coldest game of twister ever.

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:08.530
14 - The Turkey.

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:12.760
They cook the turkey by exposing it to the
time vortex over the course of the episode.

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:16.169
Baking the turkey is also a metaphor for the
arrival of Peter Capaldi.

00:04:16.169 --> 00:04:19.630
He’s baking inside Matt Smith for the episode.

00:04:19.630 --> 00:04:21.669
15 - The Papal Mainframe.

00:04:21.669 --> 00:04:24.700
The mainframe is just the spaceship headquarters
of the church.

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:25.730
Run by Tasha Lem.

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:29.000
You can think of it as a highly advanced version
of the church of england.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:30.510
16 - Tasha Lem.

00:04:30.510 --> 00:04:34.889
The actress playing her Orla Brady mentioned
during an interview that her character and

00:04:34.889 --> 00:04:39.200
the doctor had a romantic relationship at
one point and that Tasha was a bit cruel,

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:41.780
but the doctor enjoyed her so much he always
forgave her.

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:46.990
There is a theory that she is actually a version
of River Song, the strongest piece of evidence

00:04:46.990 --> 00:04:51.000
is that the doctor is only able to decode
the message from gallifrey with the seal of

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:52.000
rassilon.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:54.139
But Tasha Lem had already decoded the message
before he arrived.

00:04:54.139 --> 00:04:55.419
Which would have required time lord technology.

00:04:55.419 --> 00:05:00.889
And the daleks said that they killed her several
times, which would have only been possible

00:05:00.889 --> 00:05:02.590
if she could regenerate.

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:03.780
17 - The silents.

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:08.120
It’s revealed that the silents are actually
a genetically engineered order of preists.

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:12.780
They memory wiping abilities are merely to
prevent you from feeling guilty after confessing

00:05:12.780 --> 00:05:13.910
your sins to them.

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:19.100
The silents trying to kill the doctor during
series 6 were a rogue sect called the kovarian

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:20.100
silents.

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:21.100
Named for Madam Kovarian.

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:24.630
They were the ones the blew up the tardis,
creating a bootstrap paradox, which the doctor

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:26.240
calls the destiny trap.

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:30.020
The silents went back in time to prevent the
doctor from answering the question by blowing

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:34.730
up the tardis, but in doing so created the
very cracks in the universe that allowed the

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:37.280
time lords to eventually ask the question.

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:39.950
you can’t change history if you’re already
part of it.

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:41.370
18 - The wig.

00:05:41.370 --> 00:05:43.150
The Doctor got bored and shaved his head,
during these events he uses the wig to carry

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:44.150
a backup tardis key.

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:47.040
In real life Matt Smith had shaved his head
before production on the episode started for

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:48.880
his upcoming movie How To Catch a Monster.

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:53.020
So when they filmed the episode, he had to
wear a wig in real life.

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:56.590
Karen Gillan who appeared in the episode for
a brief cameo also had to wear an amy pond

00:05:56.590 --> 00:06:01.110
wig because she had also shaved her head for
a movie, guardians of the galaxy.

00:06:01.110 --> 00:06:04.880
In more distant doctor who history, the paul
mcgann had to wear a wig when he played the

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:06.830
8th doctor in the tv movie.

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:09.990
19 - Your ears are like rocket fins.

00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:11.330
Clara makes fun of the doctor’s ears.

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:14.190
A nice visual call back to the 9th doctor.

00:06:14.190 --> 00:06:18.780
we’re he said “could have been worse.

00:06:18.780 --> 00:06:19.780
Look at the ears.”

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:20.780
during rose.

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:21.780
20 - The Truth Field.

00:06:21.780 --> 00:06:25.190
We find out that the Time Lords are projecting
the truth field through the crack in the clock

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:26.860
tower along with the message.

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:30.050
We also learn that Clara really does fancy
the doctor.

00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:32.350
We’ve always known the Doctor was a thief.

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:35.220
Also note that the townspeople ask the doctor
his name.

00:06:35.220 --> 00:06:37.350
But he covers his mouth to keep from saying
it.

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:41.030
This is just a joke as he doesn’t know that
speaking his name is what the message is all

00:06:41.030 --> 00:06:42.030
about yet.

00:06:42.030 --> 00:06:43.650
21 - The doctor’s outfit.

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:48.280
The doctor changes into his outfit from the
2012 christmas special, the snowmen. and wears

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:52.860
it for the remainder of the episode until
he regenerates, changes back into his series

00:06:52.860 --> 00:06:55.280
7 outfit and becomes peter capaldi.

00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:56.900
22 - The Crack.

00:06:56.900 --> 00:07:00.740
The doctor finds that the message is coming
from the same type of crack seen all the way

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:01.740
back in the eleventh hour.

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:02.740
Based on the events of series 5 and 6 he explains
the structural weakness in the universe that

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:03.740
is causing the cracks.

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:05.509
We also learn that this is what the doctor’s
biggest fear is, the thing he saw inside room

00:07:05.509 --> 00:07:06.639
number 11 during the god complex.

00:07:06.639 --> 00:07:10.970
At that time he didn’t know the time lords
were the ones poking holes in the universe.

00:07:10.970 --> 00:07:15.550
He was merely afraid of the ‘weakness in
the fabric of the universe’ and all the

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:16.550
awful things that could happen as a result.

00:07:16.550 --> 00:07:17.550
23 - The seal of the high council.

00:07:17.550 --> 00:07:18.550
The doctor says that he knicked the seal of
the high council of gallifrey from the master

00:07:18.550 --> 00:07:19.550
in the death zone.

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:20.550
The seal is a key to decrypt the message.

00:07:20.550 --> 00:07:21.699
The doctor stole it during the events of the
five doctors when the master was sent to rescue

00:07:21.699 --> 00:07:24.210
the doctors from the death zone.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:29.530
24 - The first question.

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:33.340
The reason it’s called the first question
is because it’s being projected across all

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:34.720
of time and space.

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:37.199
Meaning that it’s playing at the birth of
the universe.

00:07:37.199 --> 00:07:40.870
So it’s literally the first question to
ever be uttered.

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:42.050
25 - Doctor Who?

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:46.270
The voice speaking the question is the general
of the council of time lords seen during the

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:47.410
50th anniversary.

00:07:47.410 --> 00:07:49.960
26 - What’s this planet called?

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:53.039
Trenzalore was the gravesite of the doctor
in the series 7 finale.

00:07:53.039 --> 00:07:57.080
During that timeline the doctor never uttered
his name, but did not receive the new cycle

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:58.270
or regenerations.

00:07:58.270 --> 00:07:59.270
Which is why we saw his corpse.

00:07:59.270 --> 00:08:00.270
Because that’s point at which clara prime
jumped into his timestream and because the

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:02.169
doctor changed history during the 50th anniversary,
we can assume that the final resting place

00:08:02.169 --> 00:08:03.810
might still end up being trenzalore.

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:07.060
But before the events of this christmas special,
he died during the siege of trenzalore.

00:08:07.060 --> 00:08:09.270
27 - The Doctor Who Stayed For Christmas.

00:08:09.270 --> 00:08:13.020
The doctor stays on trenzalore to keep the
alliance from destroying the planet and everyone

00:08:13.020 --> 00:08:14.020
on it.

00:08:14.020 --> 00:08:16.770
He’s staying more to help the people rather
than the time lords.

00:08:16.770 --> 00:08:20.600
28 - The seige of trenzalore.

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:25.080
For the first 300 years of the seige the church
and the doctor uphold the truce by keeping

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:28.169
out all technology, not include the sonic.

00:08:28.169 --> 00:08:30.240
Thus the wooden cyberman.

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:32.130
Which is actually played by a woman.

00:08:32.130 --> 00:08:36.070
During the standoff he uses the classic 3rd
doctor phrase reverse the polarity.

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:40.579
29 - The Sonic Still Doesn’t work on wood.

00:08:40.579 --> 00:08:45.119
Previously mentioned during the 2011 christmas
special the doctor the widow and the wardrobe

00:08:45.119 --> 00:08:46.269
and during silence in the library.

00:08:46.269 --> 00:08:47.269
30 - The Cane.

00:08:47.269 --> 00:08:48.439
Matt Smith’s aging doctor is about 1500
years old halfway through the episode.

00:08:48.439 --> 00:08:52.160
He is using a wooden cane similar to william
hartnell’s doctor.

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:53.939
He pokes the moniod puppet with it.

00:08:53.939 --> 00:08:56.800
A monster last seen during hartnell’s run.

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:57.800
31.

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:58.800
The Dance.

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:00.629
The Doctor Teaches the children the drunk
giraffe.

00:09:00.629 --> 00:09:03.679
As seen during the wedding of amy pond in
big bang.

00:09:03.679 --> 00:09:04.679
32.

00:09:04.679 --> 00:09:06.050
Clara rides outside the tardis.

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:10.690
Just like Captain Jack Harkness in utopia
in series 3 and the doctor himself during

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:12.389
hide in series 7.

00:09:12.389 --> 00:09:13.389
33.

00:09:13.389 --> 00:09:14.459
Reconnect the phone.

00:09:14.459 --> 00:09:17.819
Before Handles runs out of power he reminds
the doctor to fix the phone.

00:09:17.819 --> 00:09:20.470
Picking up the phone is a metaphor throughout
the episode.

00:09:20.470 --> 00:09:24.040
From the time lords wanting the doctor to
pick up the phone and help them bring gallifrey

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:28.379
back, to tasha lem trying to call the doctor
when the daleks invaded the papal mainframe.

00:09:28.379 --> 00:09:29.379
34.

00:09:29.379 --> 00:09:30.379
Everything ends.

00:09:30.379 --> 00:09:34.889
Everyone’s question about which number doctor
smith is and how many regens he’s used is

00:09:34.889 --> 00:09:35.889
answered.

00:09:35.889 --> 00:09:40.420
He tells clara he’s the 13th version of
himself in the 11th doctor’s body all thanks

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:43.439
to captain grumpy and the vain number 10 doubling
down.

00:09:43.439 --> 00:09:44.439
so he’s got no more regenerations.

00:09:44.439 --> 00:09:45.850
35 - The boy who waited.

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:49.180
Barnable asks the doctor if he’s coming
back and says he’ll wait.

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:50.459
the doctor smiles.

00:09:50.459 --> 00:09:52.740
remembering little amelia pond during the
eleventh hour.

00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:53.740
36.

00:09:53.740 --> 00:09:55.009
Where are the pink ones?

00:09:55.009 --> 00:09:59.369
It’s unclear whether or not the doctor is
eating jelly babies.

00:09:59.369 --> 00:10:03.170
As the only other food smith’s doctor would
crave would be fish fingers and custard.

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:04.430
Which he eats before regenerating.

00:10:04.430 --> 00:10:05.430
37.

00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:06.430
Human Form Daleks.

00:10:06.430 --> 00:10:07.689
A new creation of Series 7.

00:10:07.689 --> 00:10:13.920
In the 300 years since the truce began the
daleks invaded and assimilated the papal mainframe.

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:15.739
Including tasha lem.
38.

00:10:15.739 --> 00:10:16.999
The first doctor.

00:10:16.999 --> 00:10:20.779
When clara returns for the final time the
doctor appears extremely old.

00:10:20.779 --> 00:10:25.519
I’ve seen estimates anywhere from 600 to
900 years older than he was at the start of

00:10:25.519 --> 00:10:26.519
the episode.

00:10:26.519 --> 00:10:29.579
His hair resembles that of the first doctor
william hartnell.

00:10:29.579 --> 00:10:30.579
39.

00:10:30.579 --> 00:10:31.929
Extract from thoughts on a clock.

00:10:31.929 --> 00:10:34.519
The poem that clara reads is by Eric Richie
Junior.

00:10:34.519 --> 00:10:36.889
a character made up as part of the story.

00:10:36.889 --> 00:10:40.510
It’s unkown whether steven moffat or mark
gatiss wrote the poem.

00:10:40.510 --> 00:10:41.510
40.

00:10:41.510 --> 00:10:42.510
The Name of The Doctor.

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:47.220
Clara tells the time lords the same speech
the doctor gave her during the series 7 finale,

00:10:47.220 --> 00:10:48.999
convincing them to help the doctor.

00:10:48.999 --> 00:10:52.989
The do so by granting the doctor a new regeneration
cycle of 12.

00:10:52.989 --> 00:10:53.989
41.

00:10:53.989 --> 00:10:54.989
Up in the sky.

00:10:54.989 --> 00:10:55.989
A lot of people were confused about moving
the crack.

00:10:55.989 --> 00:10:56.989
Because the universe is so weak the time lords
are able to punch holes in it at will.

00:10:56.989 --> 00:11:00.680
Even though they could have sent the regeneration
energy through the crack inside the clocktower.

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:03.709
The sky crack is really just for dramatic
effect.

00:11:03.709 --> 00:11:04.709
42.

00:11:04.709 --> 00:11:05.709
Never tell me the rules.

00:11:05.709 --> 00:11:09.610
This is just moffat poking fun at the fandom
for obsessing over the rule of 12 for the

00:11:09.610 --> 00:11:10.610
past six months.

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:13.110
He’s just winking at us from behind the
camera.

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:14.699
Notice the glowy hands.

00:11:14.699 --> 00:11:19.029
Smith’s regeneration actually started the
minute his body took in the new cycle of 12.

00:11:19.029 --> 00:11:22.629
Meaning he’s using his first of that new
12 to become capaldi.

00:11:22.629 --> 00:11:24.980
Start the counter, we have 11 regens left.

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:25.980
43.

00:11:25.980 --> 00:11:27.079
It’s gonna be a whopper.

00:11:27.079 --> 00:11:31.959
The doctor is regenerating for the 13th time
which is extremely unusual.

00:11:31.959 --> 00:11:34.930
As a consequence he’s giving off more energy
during the process, enabling him to destroy

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:35.930
the inorganic daleks and their spaceship.

00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:36.930
Regeneration energy doesn’t kill living
things, otherwise clara and everyone else

00:11:36.930 --> 00:11:37.930
still alive in christmas town would have died
during the final blast of regeneration energy.

00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:39.550
It’s likely that when capaldi eventually
regenerates, he’ll give off even more energy.

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:40.550
44.

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:41.550
Taking a bit longer.

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:43.559
The doctor we see is already completed the
majority of the regeneration process.

00:11:43.559 --> 00:11:47.029
At the moment he’s just the echo of 11 and
the first whisper of 12.

00:11:47.029 --> 00:11:51.879
Just enough time to think about an old friend
over some fish fingers and custard.

00:11:51.879 --> 00:11:52.879
45.

00:11:52.879 --> 00:11:53.879
Goodbye raggedy man.

00:11:53.879 --> 00:11:59.140
The doctor remembers amelia pond as she was
a child and then as amy pond.

00:11:59.140 --> 00:12:00.939
It’s not a bad wolf situation.

00:12:00.939 --> 00:12:02.920
He’s just seeing her in his memory.

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:04.379
It’s been six years.

00:12:04.379 --> 00:12:06.959
so the actress playing young amelia is different.

00:12:06.959 --> 00:12:09.149
But Karen gillan returned to film the scene.

00:12:09.149 --> 00:12:14.549
As mentioned earlier she and smith are both
wearing wigs as they were bald when this was

00:12:14.549 --> 00:12:15.549
shot.

00:12:15.549 --> 00:12:16.549
46.

00:12:16.549 --> 00:12:17.549
Bowties will always be cool.

00:12:17.549 --> 00:12:19.649
Smith dropping the bowtie is the last moment
of his run.

00:12:19.649 --> 00:12:23.319
The bowtie belonged to his character just
like the scarf belonged to tom baker.

00:12:23.319 --> 00:12:27.160
So don’t be surprised if capaldi doesn’t
wear any kind of neckwear.

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:28.160
47.

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:29.529
I’ve got new kidneys.

00:12:29.529 --> 00:12:33.830
Peter capaldi’s doctor upholds the tradition
that new doctors always fixate on their new

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:35.249
physical features first.

00:12:35.249 --> 00:12:36.249
48.

00:12:36.249 --> 00:12:37.889
Do you happen to know how to fly this thing?

00:12:37.889 --> 00:12:42.029
New doctor’s are typically disoriented after
regenerating, the 8th doctor didn’t even

00:12:42.029 --> 00:12:43.139
know who he was.

00:12:43.139 --> 00:12:44.139
And the tardis is crashing, pretty much the
same thing that happened when tennant regenerated

00:12:44.139 --> 00:12:45.139
into smith.

00:12:45.139 --> 00:12:46.139
49.

00:12:46.139 --> 00:12:47.139
The final frame.

00:12:47.139 --> 00:12:49.269
Clara’s reaction shot ending is the first
regeneration to end on a character that is

00:12:49.269 --> 00:12:50.579
not the doctor.

